{
 "page": "Pilotwings64Recomp.html",
 "header": [
  "The RT64 shaders the web page builds: one shader description a line, other mode L and H, color combiner L and H,",
  "flags, in hex. RT64 specializes each one's WGSL when the page is built. In Chrome it builds the whole list behind the",
  "game from its first frame; in Firefox those above the first \"section\" line before the game starts, and a section when",
  "a frame first asks for 4 of its shaders, the game waiting. So nothing draws with the ubershader, which integrated",
  "graphics can't afford (N64Recomp-browser's README). A description in two sections is built once.",
  "",
  "Recorded by code, not by playing (the page's default settings): bash tools/record_shaders.sh (its header says how)",
  "runs N64Recomp-browser's tools/record_shaders.mjs with tools/shader_plan.json, which loads the page fresh for each",
  "test, and tools/shader_survey.js presses through the menus to the test and flies it for 12 s, banking both ways and",
  "climbing and diving. Above the first section: the launcher, the logos, the title screen and the menus up to a class",
  "overview. Then the attract demo the title screen plays when left alone; the results screen (the cannonball's shot);",
  "and a section for each island and vehicle, what every test of that vehicle on that island drew, put together by",
  "tools/merge_shader_sections.py: every test of every class, the bonus vehicles too. Not recorded: the cannonball's",
  "later targets (its code resets the test itself), the photo album, the credits and the options screen. Most of the",
  "12 s end in a crash or a landing, which draws the results. A shader the list misses is built behind the game, and",
  "the page remembers it and builds it with the rest on the next visit."
 ],
 "load": [["until", "Device Name", 60000], ["wait", 6000]],
 "setup": [["rom", 628, 364], ["wait", 4000]],
 "start": [["click", 628, 364], ["wait", 8000]],
